# --- Secrets ---
# Local-only override that injects the OpenAI key + Sentry DSN for archive builds.
# Never commit. See diewithoutregrets/Secrets.local.xcconfig.example.
diewithoutregrets/Secrets.local.xcconfig
**/Secrets.local.xcconfig

# Sentry CLI auth token (used by the dSYM upload Run Script and by
# `sentry-cli` invocations from CI / fastlane). The wizard creates this at
# repo root with `[auth] token=...`. Never commit.
.sentryclirc

# --- Xcode IDE state ---
# Per-user UI state (open tabs, scroll position, breakpoint locations).
# Changes every time you open Xcode and creates noise in PRs. Solo-project
# convention is to ignore it; multi-developer projects sometimes commit it.
*.xcuserstate
xcuserdata/

# --- SPM local repository cache ---
# `.spm/repositories/` is a local clone of every Swift Package Manager
# dependency, regenerated by Xcode on every build. The pack files inside
# are huge (Lottie alone is ~440 MB) and will trip GitHub's 100 MB hard
# limit if committed. Never commit this directory.
.spm/
